{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"本基準依建築物室內裝修管理辦法第二十九條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"金門縣-GL000160/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"4c0d57ed08f9f7df266cc6c608d36ae9152a0889e5f5d0e9008292e717e1f444","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"申請建築物室內裝修之建築物已取得使用執照者，核定施工期限為六個月，因故未能於期限內完工者，得申請展期一年，並以一次為限。","id":"金門縣-GL000160/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"7bb42af24eb18d15202638aeced4dd1205590203c451607cb8693f929dcc6a10","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三點","path":[],"text":"申請建築物室內裝修之建築物屬建造期間尚未取得使用執照者，以該建造執照之竣工期限核定為其建築物室內裝修之施工期限，因故未能於期限內完工者，得申請展期一年，並以一次為限。","id":"金門縣-GL000160/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"5932aac7ee33563602f6cfaaab0e4ecb03646f2deaae1b237f779b37e526f424","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"使用與室內裝修","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"金門縣-GL000160","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"金門縣轄內建築物室內裝修施工期限及得展期期限基準","region":"金門縣","source":"金門縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.kinmen.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000160","retrieved":"2026-09-28T09:58:40+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"9c378cad0e363353fe57d7c6c4c338a94de5fb0d0efbbec2ae61c0dace25e5a2","sourceRecordId":"金門縣-GL000160","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T10:03:59+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}